{"id":"grok-text2video-workflow-001","revision":0,"last_node_id":13,"last_link_id":8,"nodes":[{"id":8,"type":"DownloadVideo","pos":[1730,390],"size":[270,150],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video_url","name":"video_url","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"video_url"},"link":5},{"localized_name":"save_dir","name":"save_dir","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"save_dir"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"filename","name":"filename","shape":7,"type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"timeout","name":"timeout","shape":7,"type":"INT","widget":{"name":"timeout"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"本地路径","name":"本地路径","type":"STRING","links":[7]},{"localized_name":"状态","name":"状态","type":"STRING","links":[8]}],"title":"下载视频","properties":{"aux_id":"aigem/ComfyUI_LLAI_API","ver":"68e72cfc9a4e5bd25f12f5ea9642b2eda64615fb","Node name for S&R":"DownloadVideo"},"widgets_values":["","output/grok","",180]},{"id":13,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[780,720],"size":[400,280],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"⚙️ 节点参数说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## GrokText2VideoAndWait 参数\n\n### 必需参数：\n- **prompt**：视频生成提示词\n  - 详细描述场景、动作、风格\n  - 可以包含镜头运动、光线效果等\n- **model**：选择 Grok 模型 ⭐\n  - grok-video-3 (6秒) - 标准模型（默认）\n  - grok-video-3-10s (10秒) - 10秒视频专用\n- **aspect_ratio**：视频宽高比\n  - 1:1 - 方形（社交媒体）\n  - 2:3 - 竖屏（抖音、快手）\n  - 3:2 - 横屏（YouTube、B站）\n- **size**：视频分辨率\n  - 720P - 推荐（稳定）\n  - 1080P - 暂不支持\n- **api_key**：API 密钥\n\n### 可选参数：\n- **max_wait_time**：最大等待时间（秒）\n  - 默认：600（10分钟）\n  - 范围：60-1800\n- **poll_interval**：轮询间隔（秒）\n  - 默认：10\n  - 范围：5-60\n\n### 返回值：\n- 任务ID、状态、视频URL、增强提示词\n\n### 提示词示例：\n- \"一只可爱的小猫在阳光下玩耍，镜头缓慢推进，高清画质\"\n- \"城市夜景延时摄影，车流如织，霓虹闪烁，电影级画质\"\n- \"海浪拍打礁石，慢动作特写，蓝天白云，自然光线\"\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":5,"type":"PrimitiveString","pos":[270,540],"size":[400,80],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"值","name":"value","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"value"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"字符串","name":"STRING","type":"STRING","links":[2]}],"title":"🔑 Grok API Key","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.64","Node name for S&R":"PrimitiveString"},"widgets_values":["sk-22gEz1FClNzUr5I7ifCwpZhvhiJZEHjmAaNjAKkIVqjna7lz"],"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[320,690],"size":[320,400],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"📖 使用说明","properties":{},"widgets_values":["## Grok 文生视频工作流\n\n### 使用步骤：\n1. **输入 API Key**：在右侧输入你的 API Key\n2. **编写提示词**：描述想要生成的视频内容\n3. **选择模型**：\n   - grok-video-3 (6秒) - 标准模型\n   - grok-video-3-10s (10秒) - 10秒视频专用 ⭐\n4. **选择参数**：设置宽高比和分辨率\n5. **执行工作流**：点击 Queue Prompt 开始生成\n6. **等待完成**：节点会自动等待视频生成完成\n7. **预览下载**：生成完成后自动预览和下载\n\n### 模型说明：\n- **grok-video-3 (6秒)**：标准模型，生成6秒视频\n- **grok-video-3-10s (10秒)**：10秒视频专用模型\n\n### 参数说明：\n- **宽高比**：\n  - 1:1 - 方形（社交媒体）\n  - 2:3 - 竖屏（抖音、快手）\n  - 3:2 - 横屏（YouTube、B站）\n- **分辨率**：720P（推荐）、1080P（暂不支持）\n- **最大等待时间**：默认 600 秒（10分钟）\n- **轮询间隔**：默认 10 秒\n\n### 注意事项：\n- 纯文生视频，无需图片输入\n- 生成时间约 2-10 分钟\n- 确保 API Key 有效且有余额\n- 提示词要详细描述场景、动作、风格\n\n### 获取 API Key：\n访问 https://api.kuai.host/register?aff=z2C8\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":9,"type":"PreviewVideo","pos":[2020,390],"size":[400,510],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video_url","name":"video_url","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"video_url"},"link":6}],"outputs":[],"title":"视频预览","properties":{"aux_id":"aigem/ComfyUI_LLAI_API","ver":"68e72cfc9a4e5bd25f12f5ea9642b2eda64615fb","Node name for S&R":"PreviewVideo"},"widgets_values":["",""]},{"id":11,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[1420,640],"size":[260,120],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"源","name":"source","type":"*","link":7}],"outputs":[],"title":"增强提示词","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.3.64","Node name for S&R":"PreviewAny"},"widgets_values":[]},{"id":7,"type":"PreviewAny","pos":[1410,490],"size":[260,88],